# Multiplayer architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/multiplayer.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/multiplayer.md).

**Permanent decision:** design authority + replication with every shared
feature — never “MP later.” Cell / edge / client pipeline; presence follows
**mode** not ship existence; on-foot = client report + clamp; flight/combat
outcomes = cell. Peers in interest see **ships** and **characters** (appearance,
equipped gear, locomotion / combat pose, firearm fire) — not blank proxies.
In-play place changes = authored markers only. Hab/Hangar instances are real
cells; team follow-in shares the owner's cell. `interest ≤ cell size`.

When changing presence, cells, scene-exit / boarding cell resolve, instances,
follow-in, placeables, character loadout / pose / fire replication, quantum/Warp
Gate peers, or wire replication, read the full doc first. Also listed in
`AGENTS.md`.
